    {
      "id": "20261011-02-sweep-batch-zone-title-0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 198,
      "width": 2340,
      "height": 32,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "A. 后端筛选与逐笔授权（规划） → B. 链上单项原子执行（已实现）",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:21:39.504Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:21:39.504Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-02-sweep-batch-zone-1",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 30,
      "y": 930,
      "width": 2380,
      "height": 660,
      "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "strokeColor": "#ced4da",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:21:39.504Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:21:39.504Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-02-sweep-batch-zone-title-1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 948,
      "width": 2340,
      "height": 32,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "C. 每个 operationId 独立判定，批次不是资金业务键",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:21:39.504Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:21:39.504Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-02-sweep-batch-candidate",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#f3e8ff",
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "1 / 归集候选（规划）\n按 tenant / chain / vault / token 分组\n已知全部余额最终确认且风险 ALLOW\n同地址/资产仅一个可能生效授权\n完成扫描覆盖及余额对账"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:21:39.504Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:21:39.504Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-02-sweep-batch-snapshot",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#f3e8ff",
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "2 / 链上快照（规划）\n读取当前余额和源/目标 risk epochs\n读取 routeEpoch / signerEpoch\n固定 factory、walletKey、destination\namount = expectedBalance = 全余额"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:21:39.504Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:21:39.504Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-02-sweep-batch-permit",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#f3e8ff",
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "3 / 受限 RiskAuthorizer（规划）\n先落 PERMIT_POSSIBLE 再请求签名\n绑定 operationId、风险证据摘要\nhashSweep 比对 EIP-712 digest\n持久 ACK 后允许执行器取用"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:21:39.504Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:21:39.504Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-02-sweep-batch-batch",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1830,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#f3e8ff",
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "4 / Relayer 批次（规划）\nbatchDeployAndSweep(...)\n最多 50 项；operationId 不可重复\n每项 gas 100k—2M；签名 ≤4096 B\n总 calldata ≤131072 B；预留外层 Gas"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:21:39.504Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:21:39.504Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-02-sweep-batch-item",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1830,
      "y": 590,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee",
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "5 / onlyExecutor → onlySelf\n外层 nonReentrant\n逐项有界自调用 executeSweepItem\nEIP-150 余量不足 → BatchStopped\n失败回传最多复制 256 B"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:21:39.504Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:21:39.504Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-02-sweep-batch-validate",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 590,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee",
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "6 / Manager 逐项校验\n资产/租户/预测地址/非零证据\nRISK_SIGNER 签名、有效期与 epoch\n源/目标 HOLD/暂停 + 固定路由\n实时余额必须等于 expectedBalance"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:21:39.504Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:21:39.504Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-02-sweep-batch-move",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 590,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee",
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "7 / 单项原子效果\nconsume(operationId)\nFactory.deployVault(walletKey) 懒部署\n同事务初始化固定 Clone\nDepositVault.sweep 精确转出"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:21:39.504Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:21:39.504Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-02-sweep-batch-lot",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 590,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee",
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "8 / Clearing 原子记录\nrecordLot(operationId, token, amount)\nlotId = operationId\nmaturity = 当前块时间 + 观察期\n最后发 SweepExecuted"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:21:39.504Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:21:39.504Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-02-sweep-batch-success",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1010,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee",
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "成功项 / FINAL_MOVED\n规范链最终 SweepExecuted\noperationStatus = Executed\n新充值形成新 operationId\n原 operationId 永久不可重用"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:21:39.504Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:21:39.504Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-02-sweep-batch-failed",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 1010,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#fff0f0",
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "失败项 / RETRYABLE 或 UNCERTAIN\nItemFailed：该子调用全部回滚\n部署/转账/消费标记都回滚\n原 Permit 仍可能继续执行\n暂停/不再需要时撤销该 ID"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:21:39.504Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:21:39.504Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-02-sweep-batch-stopped",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1240,
      "y": 1010,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#fff0f0",
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "未执行项 / BatchStopped\n从 firstUnexecuted 起重新排队\n原授权与任务保持关联\n不能标记为已归集\n依当前链状态/有效期再评估"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:21:39.504Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:21:39.504Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-02-sweep-batch-outer",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1830,
      "y": 1010,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 210,
      "backgroundColor": "#fff0f0",
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "外层 revert / OOG\n整个批次所有子项效果回滚\n不存在有效成功事件\nGas 成本仍发生\n不能保留此前子项的逻辑成功"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:21:39.504Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:21:39.504Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-02-sweep-batch-ledger",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1350,
      "width": 2320,
      "height": 175,
      "backgroundColor": "#e3fafc",
      "strokeColor": "#0c8599",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "后端闭环（规划）：收据 + 最终成功事件 + operationStatus 三者匹配 → movement、lot 镜像、业务状态、Outbox 同 PG 事务。\nDeposit→Clearing 只记托管资产位置迁移，不再次增加用户负债；整批网络费只记一次，分项成本仅用于分析。\nGET /v1/deposits 可展示资金位置与链确认；归集执行、operationId 和授权材料不交给租户自选。"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:21:39.504Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:21:39.504Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-02-sweep-batch-note0",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1660,
      "width": 1120,
      "height": 245,
      "backgroundColor": "#fff0f0",
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "新充值或粉尘在签名后到达 → 余额变动使归集失败；不得自动扩大 amount。\n重新扫描和审查整个资产余额，再建立批准与授权。\n资金来源的干净程度不是余额相等能证明的；冻结竞态按最终链顺序处理（06）。"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:21:39.504Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:21:39.504Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-02-sweep-batch-note1",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1260,
      "y": 1660,
      "width": 1120,
      "height": 245,
      "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "label": {
        "text": "失败重试：单项失败或外层 revert 不等于业务终结。\noperationId 撤销使用 Manager.cancelOperation，由 Guardian/Council/Timelock 受控调用。\n风险 HOLD/解除提升 epoch，旧授权不会在恢复后重新有效。\n外层 success 也不表示每一项成功。"
      },
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-11T02:21:39.504Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T02:21:39.504Z",
      "version": 1
    },
